  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Meilleure protection des femmes et enfants victimes de violences</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project activities contribute to a continuous and better shelter for and guidance of women and children in the two shelters. Also, the activities include a better and more widely spread use of the Plateforme RapidProtection in order to detect, prevent and support victims through a rapid access to protection services.</narrative>
  </description>
